// The bus tap input (design `tap`): header pin 76 (IOT30B, bank 1, 3.3 V), the third pin of the right-hand header, next to GND.
// A weak pull-up so an unconnected tap reads idle (high), like the bus; a listener must not load a 1 Mbaud line. 3.3 V ONLY.
IO_LOC "tap" 76;
IO_PORT "tap" IO_TYPE=LVCMOS33 PULL_MODE=UP;
